    "turn_text": "Okay. You know, legislation is headed to the House of Representative Florida that would impose harsher consequences on anyone who leads law enforcement on a vehicle high speed chase near the border, particularly if the pursuit ends in a deadly accident. Representative wants to come on. I was told was told by Arizona's along the border that stopping the high speed chasing going on is their number one priority. Siskamani's bill of the Agent Raul Gala's Officer Safety Act is named after the officer, Border Patrol Agent who was killed in the line of duty. And we have Juan Siskamani in the center ring, and Congressman, give us some details on this bill. What exactly does it do?",
